<h2 id="decision-period-per-application" data-component-id="ind2:heading" class="ind-heading ind-heading--h2">
      Decision period per application
  </h2>

  
  

  
  

  <p>The decision period of an application is often determined by law. Does the statutory decision period end on a Saturday, Sunday or generally recognised holiday? Then the decision period will be extended until the next working day. If there is no legal decision period for an application, a reasonable decision period will apply. What is reasonable depends on the type of application.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>


  






  


