  <p>Did you apply for an asylum residence permit before June 12? Then a statutory decision period of 6 months applies to these applications. Did you apply for an asylum residence permit after June 12? Then the decision period of the standard (non-accelerated) procedure of 6 months applies. If you fall under the accelerated procedure, this is 3 months.</p><h4>Decision sometimes later</h4><p>Sometimes it can also take longer before you receive a decision. Many asylum applications are still awaiting a decision and new asylum applications are still being submitted.&nbsp;</p>

