  </h2>

  
  

  
  

  <p>The decision period starts on the first day after the final date on which you can send the letter of objection by post. This is the case even if you object to the decision earlier.</p>

<div class="ind:clear-both"></div>


  






  


<div data-component-id="ind2:accordion" class="ind-accordion">
      


<a class="ind-accordion__toggler ind-link" aria-expanded="false" data-accordion-expand-label="Expand all" data-accordion-collapse-label="Collapse all" role="button" data-component-id="ind2:link" href="#">
          <span class="ind-accordion__toggler-label">Expand all</span>

        



